type: software
title: "ECTheoryLib: A Lean 4 library for the runtime analysis of evolutionary algorithms"
version: "0.1.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Martine-li/ECTheoryLib"
authors:
  - family-names: "Li"
    given-names: "Mingfeng"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: "A Lean 4 library for evolutionary algorithm runtime analysis, following the drift analysis and probability tools of Theory of Evolutionary Computation and providing concrete algorithm models and runtime proofs."
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - formal verification
  - runtime analysis
  - drift analysis
  - evolutionary computation
